  "body": "Live in or invest in this lovely apartment with fantastic outlook and\r\nconvenience. The Nautilus is the iconic Orewa spot right in the heart of the beach village.\r\nNorth side with terrific outlook. Handy all amenities, no need to use the car!\r\n\r\n· Unfurnished\r\n· 73m2\r\n· Two Bedroom\r\n· 1 Bathroom\r\n· Level 11\r\n· Balcony, views\r\n· Full kitchen\r\n· 2 Secure Parks\r\n· Facilities Heated Pool, Hot\r\nTubs, Sauna, Gym (free use)\r\n\r\nViewings:\r\nOpen home Wednesdays and\r\nSaturdays at 11am.\r\nOther times by arrangement,\r\nplease call Eric  021702224",
